              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to BRIDGET C. ASAY, the statute\u2019s purpose is to let doctors decide whether sales representatives have access to prescribing information about them."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. Asay",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d0a0d77f92a05704880b38eb7ccc2a74e76ecabd1f876929da7c579d05bc04e7",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d0a0d77f92a0-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 21,
                "start": 21
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. Asay, the first clause of the statute restricts sales except for the exemptions listed in the law."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Vermont",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d0a0d77f92a05704880b38eb7ccc2a74e76ecabd1f876929da7c579d05bc04e7",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d0a0d77f92a0-0002-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 41,
                "start": 40
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Vermont, if Vermont truly protected doctors\u2019 privacy, it would not contain the many exemptions; a genuine privacy provision would make the information private."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "State of Vermont",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d0a0d77f92a05704880b38eb7ccc2a74e76ecabd1f876929da7c579d05bc04e7",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d0a0d77f92a0-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 56
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to State of Vermont, the statute includes a parallel formulary\u2011compliance exemption and other provisions that reflect advocacy by insurance companies."
        }
      ],
